    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 222]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(My School Teacher)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My teacher’s name is Ms. Kang."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She loves children and makes learning fun."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes she tells us great stories."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She is a good teacher."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She has a habit biting her nails, when she teaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Sometimes she bites herself too hard and shouts out in pain."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My teacher is helping me realize my dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My teacher also always tells us"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "to set goals in order to reach our dreams."
    },
